{"id":112,"name":"rhydon","speciesId":112,"dex":112,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["ground","rock"],"stats":{"hp":105,"attack":130,"defense":120,"special-attack":45,"special-defense":45,"speed":40},"abilities":[{"name":"lightning-rod","hidden":false},{"name":"rock-head","hidden":false},{"name":"reckless","hidden":true}],"height":19,"weight":1200,"baseExp":170,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/112.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/112.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/112.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/112.ogg","genus":"Drill Pokémon","genusPt":"Treinar Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Walks on its hind legs. Shows signs of intelligence. Its armor-like hide even repels molten lava."},{"version":"gold","text":"Its rugged hide protects it from even the heat of lava. However, the hide also makes it insensitive."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its brain devel­ oped when it began walking on hind legs. Its thick hide protects it even in magma."},{"version":"crystal","text":"By lightly spin­ ning its drill- like horn, it can easily shatter even a diamond in the rough."},{"version":"ruby","text":"RHYDON’s horn can crush even uncut diamonds. One sweeping blow of its tail can topple a building. This POKéMON’s hide is extremely tough. Even direct cannon hits don’t leave a scratch."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"RHYDON has a horn that serves as a drill. It is used for destroying rocks and boulders. This POKéMON occasionally rams into streams of magma, but the armor-like hide prevents it from feeling the heat."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its horn, which rotates like a drill, destroys tall buildings with one strike. It stands on its hind legs, and its brain is well developed."},{"version":"firered","text":"It begins walking on its hind legs after evolution. It can punch holes through boulders with its horn."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its brain developed when it began walking on hind legs. Its thick hide protects it even in magma."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Rhydon’s horn can crush even uncut diamonds. One sweeping blow of its tail can topple a building. This Pokémon’s hide is extremely tough. Even direct cannon hits don’t leave a scratch."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rhydon has a horn that serves as a drill. It is used for destroying rocks and boulders. This Pokémon occasionally rams into streams of magma, but the armor-like hide prevents it from feeling the heat."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its brain developed when it began walking on its hind legs. Its armor-like hide even repels molten lava."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Rapidly rotates its horn to bore through bedrock. It swaggers around volcanic regions, protected from the lava's heat by its tough, armorlike hide."}],"flavorPt":"Gira rapidamente seu chifre para perfurar a rocha. Ele anda por regiões vulcânicas, protegido do calor da lava por sua pele resistente e semelhante a uma armadura.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["monster","ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rhyhorn","speciesId":111,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 42"],"species":"rhydon","speciesId":112,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca